Wild Bees are found around [[Wild Beehive]]s. When raiding a beehive, all the bees guarding it will attack.

==Combat==

Taking damage from bees will result in [[Wounds|Beestings]].

===Behaviour===

Raiding an [[Wild Beehive]] causes all nearby bees to attack.

