===Strategy===

Because bees have a relatively low amount of hp, it is best to quickly create one opening by using basic attacks such as punch, low blow, or kick, and disregard using restorations.
Raiding a beehive causes all nearby bees to attack, so killing them beforehand is important to a successful raid. Being attacked by multiple bee swarms will quickly overwhelm you and create large blue and green openings, making it very difficult to recover quick enough.